# Component Reuse

Always check for existing components before building anything new.

## Rules

- **Reuse first**: Before implementing any UI element, scan the prototype files for an existing component that matches — dropdowns, inputs, radio buttons, checkboxes, app bar, buttons, typography, spacing patterns.
- **Ask before creating**: If no existing component covers the need, explicitly ask the user for confirmation before building a new one. Describe what would be new and why.
- **Match exactly**: When reusing a component, replicate its full HTML structure, CSS class names, and JS behavior — do not simplify or invent variations.

