## Dropdown arrow

Always use `assets/dropdown-down-icon.png` as the chevron — never inline SVG paths.

```html
<span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
```
```css
.chevron {
  width: 16px; height: 16px;
  background: url("assets/dropdown-down-icon.png") center / 16px 16px no-repeat;
}
```
